cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rfam-seed-qc, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "rfam-seed-qc"
abstract: >-
  Tools for ensuring the quality of multiple sequence alignments (MSAs) in
  Rfam. Validates Stockholm seed alignments and automatically fixes common
  issues: missing coordinates, duplicate and overlapping sequences, and
  sequences that do not match their NCBI or RNAcentral source, with a BLAST
  fallback.
authors:
  - family-names: Madrigal
    given-names: Pedro
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1959-8199"
version: 1.1.3
date-released: 2026-07-16
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rfam/rfam-seed-qc"
keywords:
  - Rfam
  - RNA
  - Stockholm format
  - multiple sequence alignment
  - quality control
